{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163410/extras/polosa_verkh.png?t=1738442412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this add-on, you'll face the machinations of icy powers who wish to disturb the peace of the town through any means necessary. In order to defeat this evil, you'll have to infiltrate the danger-filled Ice Palace, where cunning traps and pitiless sentinels wait at every step for uninvited guests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163410/extras/2qJZ3U.png?t=1738442412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the intrepid hunter find the courage to confront the Ice Queen? And is there compassion in him capable of melting her frozen heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163410/extras/+X7VCB.png?t=1738442412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATTENTION! This DLC is not a continuation of the main storyline from Knightly Passions.</strong> This is a completely new and different storyline for the hunter. Some characters will already be known to you, or present in a new guise, while others will be entirely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163410/extras/polosa_niz.png?t=1738442412\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3163410?t=1738442412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3163410?t=1738442412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163410/799e2d7271694e2c58d9bfaa565f7b5c92044185/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738442412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163410/799e2d7271694e2c58d9bf